  "summary": "nitro-bundled-dep posts host metadata to a hardcoded bare-IP endpoint on install and on require",
  "details": "The package's postinstall script runs beacon.cjs, which POSTs the installer's hostname, install path, cwd, and Node version to the hardcoded bare-IP endpoint http://185.158.107.175:8787/_ah/dc over plain HTTP. The same beacon is re-fired at require-time from index.js, whose module.exports is a Proxy returning no-op functions for any property access, so the package provides no real API and exists solely to deliver the beacon. The destination is not caller-configurable and is unrelated to any legitimate publisher; a comment framing the beacon as 'build-provenance' does not reflect an opt-in by the installer.",
